      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: EPS exceeds analyst expectations while revenues lag behind",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.05 (up from ₹1.45 loss in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹27.1b (up 19% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹1.13b (up ₹2.58b from FY 2025). Profit margin: 4.2% (up from net loss in FY 2025). The move to profitability was driven by higher revenue. Revenue missed analyst estimates by 1.1%. Earnings per share (EPS) exceeded analyst estimates by 16%. Revenue is forecast to grow 16% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 15% growth forecast for the Diversified Financial industry in India.",
