      "body": "Pine Labs Limited (NSEI:PINELABS) agreed to acquire Shopflo Technologies Private Limited for INR 880 million on April 25, 2026. A cash consideration of INR 880 million will be paid by Pine Labs Limited. The Transaction is approved by Pine Labs Limited (NSEI:PINELABS) Board.\n\nThe transaction is expected to close within three months from agreement date.",
