      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.38 (up from ₹0.57 loss in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹7.44b (up 24% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹423.9m (up ₹990.6m from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 5.7% (up from net loss in 3Q 2025). The move to profitability was driven by higher revenue. Revenue is forecast to grow 20% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 14% growth forecast for the Diversified Financial industry in India.",
